    "title": "Hexa Away",
    "description": "Hexa Away is a fun and addictive puzzle game, but it's much more than that. A brain teaser that will take you to the next level.\r\n\r\nTap the hexagon tile to move it and clear the screen. However, the hexagon tile only moves in one direction, so you need to approach this brain teaser carefully. Plan your strategy by imagining where the hex will move on the screen! .\r\nAs the game progresses, the number of hexagon tile increases and various obstacles are created, so you will need to use your thinking skills to solve the puzzles of this puzzle game. This fun and colorful game challenges your logic, critical thinking, and accuracy. Do you have what you need?",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hexa Away is a fun and addictive puzzle game, but it&#39;s much more than that. A brain teaser that will take you to the next level.<br><br>Tap the hexagon tile to move it and clear the screen. However, the hexagon tile only moves in one direction, so you need to approach this brain teaser carefully. Plan your strategy by imagining where the hex will move on the screen! .<br>As the game progresses, the number of hexagon tile increases and various obstacles are created, so you will need to use your thinking skills to solve the puzzles of this puzzle game. This fun and colorful game challenges your logic, critical thinking, and accuracy. Do you have what you need?",
